esolate Zone? Yeah, why?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Kim Face Set 5", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Fuck me, all that time we spent looking "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["and you stumble in without even knowing.\\."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["How did you do it? How did you get in?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["In the city? I came through the sewers "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I guess? But it's back through all those "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["zombies.\\. Speaking of which, what's"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["with all the zombies?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Kim Face Set 5", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Hmph, wish I knew. They showed up not "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["too long after we all arrived, first it "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["was just a few, then there were dozens, "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["then hundreds. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["They just showed up?\\. Strange, I wonder "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["if it's to do with this place's orb..."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Kim Face Set 5", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Orb? What are you talking about?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I'm on a quest to find each zone's "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["treasure, supposedly they'll help us "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["fight our way out of this game. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I've found two so far."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["And a sudden wave of zombies sounds "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["like a good place to start looking for "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["this one."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Kim Face Set 5", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["A way out...\\.I hope you find it."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Thanks for saving my life by the way..."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Kim Face Set 5", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Don't mention it."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 123, "parameters": ["A", 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 0, "parameters": []}], "moveFrequency": 3, "moveRoute": {"repeat": true, "skippable": false, "wait": false, "list": [{"code": 0, "parameters": []}]}, "moveSpeed": 3, "moveType": 0, "priorityType": 0, "stepAnime": false, "through": false, "trigger": 3, "walkAnime": true, "image": {"tileId": 0, "characterName": "", "characterIndex": 0, "direction": 2, "pattern": 0}}, {"conditions": {"switch1Valid": false, "switch2Valid": false, "variableValid": false, "selfSwitchValid": true, "itemValid": false, "actorValid": false, "switch1Id": 1, "switch2Id": 1, "variableId": 1, "variableValue": 0, "selfSwitchCh": "A", "itemId": 1, "actorId": 1}, "directionFix": false, "list": [{"indent": 0, "code": 108, "parameters": ["<page trigger: Region_enter 1>"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 250, "parameters": [{"name": "Poison", "pitch": 110, "volume": 80}]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 224, "parameters": [[255, 0, 0, 255], 15, true]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 205, "parameters": [-1, {"repeat": false, "skippable": false, "wait": true, "list": [{"code": 19, "parameters": []}, {"code": 41, "parameters": ["Original Player Sprite", 5]}, {"code": 0, "parameters": []}]}]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 505, "parameters": [[{"code": 19, 